{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains flashing lights and imagery that can\u00a0cause epileptic seizures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face of Another</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience where a mysterious entity traps you inside a warped digital nightmare. In a world where technology distorts reality, your only lifeline is your phone. Use it to capture clues, solve puzzles, and survive the horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272170/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1753036914\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control a smartphone (Take photos, solve puzzles and more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect 7 different phone cases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Digital horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272170/extras/Glitch_gif.gif?t=1753036914\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3272170?t=1753036914","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3272170?t=1753036914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272170/75395ad313a023b199d4eae917e80e30d364e4dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753036914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272170/75395ad313a023b199d4eae917e80e30d364e4dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753036914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achieveme